{"seq":1,"slug":"english-learning","title":"英语学习","stage":"DONE","category":"english-learning","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning","rating":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 英语学习 简介\n\n英语作为全球使用最广泛的语言之一，是国际交流、学术研究和职业发展的重要工具。对于技术从业者而言，掌握英语不仅意味着能够阅读第一手技术文档和论文，更意味着能够参与全球化的技术社区，与世界各地的开发者进行高效沟通与协作。\n\n本知识库面向希望系统性提升英语能力的中文母语学习者，尤其是程序员和技术工作者。无论你是刚开始接触英语，还是已有一定基础但希望突破瓶颈，这里都将提供科学、实用的学习方法与资源。\n\n知识库将涵盖以下核心内容：语音与发音基础，帮助你建立准确的听说能力；词汇与语法体系，构建扎实的语言根基；阅读与写作技巧，提升输入输出的综合水平；听力与口语训练方法，增强实际交流能力；以及技术英语专项，聚焦编程、文档阅读和技术演讲等场景。我们将结合语言学习理论与实际案例，帮助你制定个性化的学习计划，实现从被动理解到主动运用的跨越。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"grammar-foundations","title":"语法基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"parts-of-speech","title":"词性与句子成分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations/parts-of-speech"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tenses-and-voice","title":"时态与语态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations/tenses-and-voice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"clauses-and-complex-sentences","title":"从句与复合句","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations/clauses-and-complex-sentences"},{"seq":4,"slug":"common-grammar-mistakes","title":"常见语法错误","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations/common-grammar-mistakes"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"vocabulary-strategies","title":"词汇策略","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/vocabulary-strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"root-affix-method","title":"词根词缀记忆法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/vocabulary-strategies/root-affix-method"},{"seq":2,"slug":"context-and-collocations","title":"语境记忆与